  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Track II Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Track II Engagement: Track II programming brings together Azerbaijani and Armenian participants for confidence-building exercises and conflict resolution seminars. The project(s) will provide participants a chance to move beyond stereotypes, identify ways of overcoming obstacles in conflict situations, discuss the Armenia-Azerbaijan conflict in a neutral venue, and outline joint approaches to contribute to the peace process.</narrative>
  </description>
